530
00:26:07,133 --> 00:26:09,620
Did that samurai kill you?

531
00:26:10,580 --> 00:26:13,180
If you're not dead yet, say so!

532
00:26:21,400 --> 00:26:22,677
Hey! Samurai!

533
00:26:22,760 --> 00:26:23,940
You wanna fight?

534
00:26:24,620 --> 00:26:25,820
He's a killer!

535
00:26:25,960 --> 00:26:27,019
He'll kill us too!

536
00:26:27,240 --> 00:26:28,677
Now you have an appetite.

537
00:26:28,760 --> 00:26:30,701
This is stress-eating, thank you!

538
00:26:35,080 --> 00:26:37,677
Well, there's something else
about this that's fishy.

539
00:26:37,760 --> 00:26:41,407
The guy making the emergency
call said it was cold, didn't he?

540
00:26:41,700 --> 00:26:43,240
Please! It's cold!

541
00:26:43,540 --> 00:26:46,040
We need Buzz! Yeah, he did.

542
00:26:46,280 --> 00:26:48,560
But how can he be cold and on fire?

543
00:26:49,300 --> 00:26:50,480
Maybe he's stupid.

544
00:26:51,100 --> 00:26:52,797
I don't, that's the issue here!

545
00:26:52,880 --> 00:26:55,586
Can there be a cold place
on a burning island?

546
00:26:55,780 --> 00:26:59,337
Or perhaps he was cold simply
because he was bleeding to death.

547
00:26:59,420 --> 00:27:02,008
Robin, can you keep
those stars to yourself?

548
00:27:04,860 --> 00:27:06,680
This is nice and cold, too.

549
00:27:08,960 --> 00:27:13,097
The sky on the far side of the island
is different than the sky on our side.

550
00:27:13,180 --> 00:27:16,709
Almost like the weather is the
complete opposite over there.

551
00:27:17,560 --> 00:27:19,200
Not our problem, I guess.

552
00:27:22,880 --> 00:27:23,860
It's a giant!

553
00:27:26,240 --> 00:27:27,940
It's way bigger than that.

554
00:27:34,760 --> 00:27:35,590
My goodness.

555
00:27:46,260 --> 00:27:47,300
Oh wow!

556
00:27:47,780 --> 00:27:49,660
Those things are real? Crazy!

557
00:27:51,000 --> 00:27:51,857
No way!

558
00:27:51,940 --> 00:27:54,116
Whatever this is, it must be a trick.

559
00:27:54,280 --> 00:27:56,456
Those things are only in fairy tales.

560
00:27:57,540 --> 00:27:59,057
And yet, just look at it.

561
00:27:59,140 --> 00:28:00,964
What else could it possibly be?

562
00:28:26,320 --> 00:28:27,440
A dragon?

563
00:28:34,760 --> 00:28:35,590
You
